{
 "_provenance": "The modern (tv.plex.*) agents of a real PMS 1.43.4, captured from GET /system/agents and /system/agents?mediaType=N in XML. `mediaTypes` names which agents each library type lists. The legacy com.plexapp.agents.* plug-ins the reference also lists are deliberately absent: simplex hosts no plug-in framework, so their prefs, contributors and attribution would all be invented. Cycle 17: the two `tv.plex.agents.nfo.*` rows are 1.43.4's and are gone -- zen (1.42.2, the build simplex reports) lists four modern agents on the bare path and two per media type, kids (1.43.4) six and three, measured over the bare path and every `mediaType=`. Offering one to the Add Library dialog is an agent a server of this version does not have. Cycle 87: `mediaTypes` held only 1, 2, 3, 4, 8 and 13. Swept on kids and zen over `mediaType=1..129`: 9 (album) and 10 (track) list Plex Music and Plex Personal Media, and 14, 20, 21 and 22 Personal Media alone -- the same table zen's `/media/providers/metadata` gives as each provider's `MetadataType` list. Plex Web's Agents settings page asks for 9 (its Albums tab) and keeps `tv.plex.agents.none`, so simplex's Albums tab was missing a row.",
